    "description": "<h3 data-path-to-node=\"1\">Rendimiento y Almacenamiento</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"2\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capacidad de Almacenamiento:</b> <b data-path-to-node=\"2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">240 GB</b>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tipo de Unidad:</b> Unidad de Estado S\u00f3lido (SSD).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Velocidad de Lectura Secuencial:</b> Hasta <b data-path-to-node=\"2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">545 MB/s</b>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Velocidad de Transferencia de la Interfaz:</b> 6 Gbit/s (L\u00edmite te\u00f3rico del bus de datos).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Compatibilidad NVMe:</b> No compatible (Esta unidad utiliza el protocolo AHCI a trav\u00e9s del canal SATA).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\">Interfaz y Factor de Forma</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Interfaz F\u00edsica:</b> <b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">SATA III</b>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Factor de Forma:</b> <b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">M.2</b> (Dise\u00f1o ultradelgado tipo tarjeta, ideal para ahorrar espacio en sistemas compactos).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">Confiabilidad y Seguridad</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tiempo Medio Entre Fallos (MTBF):</b> <b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">1,000,000 de horas</b> (Alta durabilidad y confiabilidad operativa).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Encriptaci\u00f3n por Hardware:</b> No disponible.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Componente para:</b> Equipos multifuncionales, impresoras industriales, sistemas integrados o computadoras de uso cotidiano.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Dimensiones y Pesos del Componente</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ancho:</b> 69.8 mm.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Profundidad:</b> 100.7 mm.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Altura:</b> 7 mm.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Peso Neto:</b> Ligero de solo <b data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"26\">36.2 g</b>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Condiciones Ambientales de Trabajo</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intervalo de Temperatura Operativa:</b> 0 \u00b0C a 70 \u00b0C (M\u00e1xima temperatura de trabajo permitida: 70 \u00b0C).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intervalo de Temperatura de Almacenaje:</b> -55 \u00b0C a 85 \u00b0C.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Resumen de Especificaciones</h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Caracter\u00edstica</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Detalle</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tipo de Componente</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\">Unidad de Estado S\u00f3lido (SSD) Interna</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Factor de Forma</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,2,1,0\">M.2 (Conexi\u00f3n SATA)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Capacidad Real</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,3,1,0\">240 GB</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Velocidad de Lectura</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,4,1,0\">Hasta 545 MB/s</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vida \u00datil Estimada</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"13,5,1,0\">1 mill\u00f3n de horas (MTBF)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Punto destacado:</b> Esta unidad SSD de 240GB en formato <b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">M.2 SATA</b> destaca como una opci\u00f3n ideal para actualizar o dar mantenimiento a <b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"130\">equipos multifuncionales</b> o sistemas embebidos que requieren un arranque r\u00e1pido y un almacenamiento fiable sin el peso ni las partes m\u00f3viles de un disco mec\u00e1nico tradicional. Con un peso de apenas <b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"326\">36.2 gramos</b> y una velocidad de lectura estable de <b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"376\">545 MB/s</b>, ofrece un excelente balance entre eficiencia t\u00e9rmica (soportando hasta 70 \u00b0C en operaci\u00f3n) y un tiempo medio entre fallos de un mill\u00f3n de horas, asegurando la continuidad del flujo de trabajo diario.</p>\n",
